{"title": "Keen Senses", "pageid": 3955, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Keen_Senses", "categories": ["Racial features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Keen Senses</b> is a passive feature that grants <a href=\"/wiki/Elf\" title=\"Elf\">Elves</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Drow\" title=\"Drow\">Drow</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">Proficiency</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You are <a href=\"/wiki/Proficient\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficient\">Proficient</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Races:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Character level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Elf\" title=\"Elf\">Elf</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Drow\" title=\"Drow\">Drow</a></li></ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:85%;\">(<a href=\"/wiki/Character_level\" title=\"Character level\">Character level</a> is the sum of all class levels for a multi-classed character.)</span>\n</p>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201957\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 465/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2469/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 597/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 11/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643407/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\